OL,9,G1330 Music Map
OL,10,     FSara Mohr-Pietsch traces musical
OL,11,     Fconnections with Jean-Philippe
OL,12,     FRameau's 'Tristes apprets', the
OL,13,     Fexquisite aria from his 1737 opera
OL,14,     FCastor et Pollux.
OL,15,G1500 Music Matters: How to listen
OL,16,     F1/3. Conductor Sakari Oramo opens
OL,17,     Fa window into the art of attentive
OL,18,     Flistening. Today, Sakari explores
OL,19,     Fthe act of listening itself - what
OL,20,     Fdo we actually hear when we listen
OL,21,     Fto music?
